---
title: "Mikumi or Nyerere Day Safari"
description: "Fly from Zanzibar to mainland Tanzania for a day safari in Mikumi or Nyerere National Park, with game drives, park fees and flights included."
permalink: "/tours/mikumi-nyerere-day-safari/"
tour_slug: "mikumi-nyerere-day-safari"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b8860b 0%, var(--dct-spice) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-safari">SAF — Safari</span>
      <h1>Mikumi or Nyerere fly-in day safari</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">8–10 hours · Zanzibar → mainland Tanzania → Zanzibar</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "mikumi-nyerere-day-safari" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-sns-booking-open data-service-slug="{{ tour_slug }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Check price &amp; book</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "tour-booking-panel.njk" %}

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Escape to mainland Tanzania for a thrilling day safari. Fly from Zanzibar to either Mikumi National Park (famous for the "S" curve of the river) or Nyerere National Park (formerly Selous Game Reserve, vast wetlands and wildlife). Return the same evening.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>Morning flight from Zanzibar to Mwanza or Dar es Salaam (chartered, 1.5 hours)</li>
      <li>4-hour game drive in 4x4 with a licensed Tanzanian guide</li>
      <li>Park fees, lunch, and refreshments included</li>
      <li>Evening return flight to Zanzibar</li>
      <li>Spot elephants, lions, hippos, crocodiles, giraffes, and over 400 bird species</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Full day (8–10 hours including flights)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Abeid Amani Karume International Airport (ZNZ) — transfer from your hotel included</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Flight-dependent — weather permitting only</li>
      <li>Must use a licensed mainland operator (we handle this)</li>
      <li>Minimum 2 passengers for charter flights — single supplement applies</li>
      <li>Best months: June–October and December–March (dry seasons)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Flights, game drive, park fees, lunch</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Physical Demand & Requirements</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #00667c;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">💪 Physical Demand: Moderate-High</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Full day: flights + 4hr game drive in 4x4. Long day with early start.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👶 Age Guidelines</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Age 6+ recommended; single supplement for solo</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #9c27b0;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👥 Group Size</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Min 2 for charter flight; Private: 1–6 per vehicle</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#f0f9ff;border-left:4px solid #00667c;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">☁️ Weather Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Flight weather-dependent; flexible date policy. 30% deposit.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">🎒 What to Bring</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;line-height:1.8;">
              <li>Neutral-colored clothing</li>
              <li>Binoculars</li>
              <li>Camera with zoom</li>
              <li>Hat & sunscreen</li>
              <li>Light fleece for morning</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">📍 Meeting Point</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Zanzibar Airport (flight included)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⏱️ Duration</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">12–14 hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#fff3e0;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⚠️ Cancellation & Booking Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">30% deposit; weather-dependent flights with flexible date policy.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>📍 Tour Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">Full day (8–10 hours including flights)</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Zanzibar → mainland Tanzania → Zanzibar</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ "SAF" | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified published rate • TANAPA national park fees &amp; flights included • 30% deposit locks flight manifest</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
